 468:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @brief Enter Stop mode
 469:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  This API is named HAL_PWR_EnterSTOPMode to ensure compatibility with legacy code running
 470:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        on devices where only "Stop mode" is mentioned with main or low power regulator ON.
 471:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  In Stop mode, all I/O pins keep the same state as in Run mode.
 472:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  All clocks in the VCORE domain are stopped; the PLL,
 473:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        the HSI and the HSE oscillators are disabled. Some peripherals with the wakeup capabilit
 474:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        (I2Cx, LPUART) can switch on the HSI to receive a frame, and switch off the HSI
 475:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        after receiving the frame if it is not a wakeup frame. In this case, the HSI clock is pr
 476:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        only to the peripheral requesting it.
 477:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        SRAM1, SRAM2 and register contents are preserved.
 478:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        The BOR is available.
 479:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        The voltage regulator can be configured either in normal (Stop 0) or low-power mode (Sto
 480:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  When exiting Stop 0 or Stop 1 mode by issuing an interrupt or a wakeup event,
 481:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *         the HSI RC oscillator is selected as system clock.
 482:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  When the voltage regulator operates in low power mode (Stop 1), an additional
 483:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *         startup delay is incurred when waking up.
 484:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *         By keeping the internal regulator ON during Stop mode (Stop 0), the consumption
 485:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *         is higher although the startup time is reduced.
 486:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @param Regulator: Specifies the regulator state in Stop mode.
 487:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 488:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *            @arg @ref PWR_MAINREGULATOR_ON  Stop 0 mode (main regulator ON)
 489:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *            @arg @ref PWR_LOWPOWERREGULATOR_ON  Stop 1 mode (low power regulator ON)
 490:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @param STOPEntry: Specifies Stop 0 or Stop 1 mode is entered with WFI or WFE instruction.
 491:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 492:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *            @arg @ref PWR_STOPENTRY_WFI  Enter Stop 0 or Stop 1 mode with WFI instruction.
 493:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *            @arg @ref PWR_STOPENTRY_WFE  Enter Stop 0 or Stop 1 mode with WFE instruction.
 494:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @retval None
 495:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   */
