 512:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @brief Enter Standby mode.
 513:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  In Standby mode, the PLL, the HSI and the HSE oscillators are switched
 514:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        off. The voltage regulator is disabled, except when SRAM2 content is preserved
 515:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        in which case the regulator is in low-power mode.
 516:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        SRAM1 and register contents are lost except for registers in the Backup domain and
 517:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        Standby circuitry. SRAM2 content can be preserved if the bit RRS is set in PWR_CR3 regis
 518:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        To enable this feature, the user can resort to HAL_PWREx_EnableSRAM2ContentRetention() A
 519:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        to set RRS bit.
 520:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        The BOR is available.
 521:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @retval None
 522:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   */
